roll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Awesome! So possibly another week?</div> </div> </div> </div>For David and I (plus help from the writing team) to go through the doc and then send changes back to layout, then the file goes to CCP for approval. If there are changes to be made those have to be dealt with, which can be minor or major depending on what they area and how long it takes to rework them.<br /> <br /> This is why giving specific dates can be problematic.<br /> <br /> -Matt","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Owner/Editor - FlamesRising.com","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/949-matt-m-mcelroy","name":"Matt-M-McElroy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar949_2.jpeg","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T05:40:55-07:00","id":90148,"title":"","content":"Sweet. Thanks guys for the updates and the awesome work that you put into this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2441-rez960","name":"rez960","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T14:01:16-07:00","id":90414,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt-M-McElroy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/84923-htv-mortal-remains?p=90130#post90130\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> For David and I (plus help from the writing team) to go through the doc and then send changes back to layout, then the file goes to CCP for approval. If there are changes to be made those have to be dealt with, which can be minor or major depending on what they area and how long it takes to rework them.<br /> <br /> This is why giving specific dates can be problematic.<br /> <br /> -Matt</div> </div> </div> </div>CCP approving it was what I was thinking of. You'd think I'd have the entire system memorized by now.<br /> <br /> Still, as a rough guess goes, before the end of the month doesn't seem unreasonable, although as always don't cling to closely to precise dates.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T19:37:07-07:00","id":90583,"title":"","content":"Something I'm not to clear on, but the new Conspiracies and Endowments are they written for the GMC rule set or written using the old rule set. IE if I didn't want to use the GMC rules update would the new mechanic material still work or would I have to do my own conversions back to the old material?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>in any fight<br /> it is the guy who is willing to die<br /> who is going to win that inch.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/BlackRoleplayersOrganization\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/BlackRoleplayersOrganization</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1402-kael-winters","name":"Kael Winters","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1402_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T01:44:12-07:00","id":90742,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kael Winters</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/84923-htv-mortal-remains?p=90583#post90583\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Something I'm not to clear on, but the new Conspiracies and Endowments are they written for the GMC rule set or written using the old rule set. IE if I didn't want to use the GMC rules update would the new mechanic material still work or would I have to do my own conversions back to the old material?</div> </div> </div> </div>They're written with GMC in mind. But they're not that mechanically intensive. If there's any conversion, it will be super minimal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T21:17:26-07:00","id":91380,"title":"","content":"In the event of the creation of the Hunter Chronicle book, might a supplement be produced that presents overhauls of the secondary organizations (Cainites, Talbot Group, etc.)? And perhaps the Compact Endowments as well?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-15T02:06:53-07:00","id":91489,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shkspr1048</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/84923-htv-mortal-remains?p=91380#post91380\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the event of the creation of the Hunter Chronicle book, might a supplement be produced that presents overhauls of the secondary organizations (Cainites, Talbot Group, etc.)? And perhaps the Compact Endowments as well?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that hypothetically, we'd want to try to tie-in a number of those supplement groups and make it more inclusive. So, possibly. <br /> <br /> That's a long way out though, and depends on how Idigam and Fallen World do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-15T20:50:16-07:00","id":92081,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/84923-htv-mortal-remains?p=91489#post91489\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I think that hypothetically, we'd want to try to tie-in a number of those supplement groups and make it more inclusive. So, possibly. That's a long way out though, and depends on how Idigam and Fallen World do.</div> </div> </div> </div> In other words, everyone buy both of those books if you want there to potentially future Chronicle books for Hunter and the other splats <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"ke